title: Shots in the Square
subtitle: The police fire on a demonstration.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('shooting'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('shooting');
Q.lw_dead = RG.lw.rnd(3, 14);
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {militancy: 6, members: -0.01});
RG.news('Police fire on demonstrators in ' + Q.lw_town + ': ' + Q.lw_dead + ' dead', 3);
RG.ledger('The police killed ' + Q.lw_dead + ' demonstrators in ' + Q.lw_town + '.', 'lw_shoot_' + Q.lw_d);
!}

= Shots in the Square

Ten thousand marched to the town hall of **[+ lw_town +]** against the price of bread. Someone threw a stone, or a bottle, or nothing at all: the witnesses do not agree. The security police on the steps opened fire with rifles, and then with a machine gun.

[+ lw_dead +] are dead, among them a girl of fifteen.

- @strike: Call a general strike in the district.
- @funeral: Bury the dead with all the workers' parties.
- @defence: Form armed squads for the next demonstration.

@strike
subtitle: [+ lw_d_name +] stops for its dead.
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike(Q.lw_d);
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 5});
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

By ten in the morning nothing moves in [+ lw_d_name +]: no trams, no works, no pits.

@funeral
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A common grief, and a common front. Many workers want it.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any joint action with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.against('united_front');
Q.spd_relation += 8;
Q.worker_support += 3;
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 2, 5);
!}

The coffins are carried through [+ lw_town +] under the flags of three parties and every union. At the graveside a social democrat and a communist speak from the same cart.

@defence
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Next time the workers will shoot back.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed squads.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.against('uprising');
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {guards: 0.8, repression: 6});
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 2, 5);
!}

The young men who carried the wounded from the square come to the district office the next day, asking for rifles. The district finds some.
